\end{align}
where the infimum is over all product measurements on $AB$. In this notation, Lemma~\ref{lem:product-ic-meas} shows that

where the infimum is over all product measurements on $AB$. In this notation, Lemma~\ref{lem:product-ic-meas} shows that
