\end{align}
using state two-designs and properties of weighted non-commutative $L_p$-spaces. In fact, after completion of our work we realised that methods from operator space theory even give the stronger bound

using state two-designs and properties of weighted non-commutative $L_p$-spaces. In fact, after completion of our work we realised that methods from operator space theory even give the stronger bound
