For the quantum mutual information we have $I\left(A:Z_1^n\right)_{\rho}:=D(\rho_{AZ_1^n}\|\rho_A\otimes \rho_{Z_1^n}) \leq \log d_A$ as well as (see, e.g., \cite[Chapter 11]{nielsen00})
\begin{align}
I\left(A:Z_1^n\right)_{\rho}=\sum_{m=0}^{n-1} I(A : Z_{m+1} | Z_1^m)_{\rho}
\end{align}
