&\leq\mathrm{Tr}\left[G_{AB} (W_{A} \otimes W_{B})\right]+\frac{\mathrm{poly}(d)}{\sqrt{n}},
\end{align}
where we used H\"older's inequality and the de Finetti argument as in Theorem \ref{thm:main-deFinetti}.
